<p>Today's brief covers stories from 12 to 13 November.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Agents</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">ChatGPT Wallet<em>agents that can pay</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Platforms</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>Apify<em>customer tokens accessed</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Hardware</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">Nvidia<em>CEO resigns, interim chief named</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Enforcement</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>FBI and DOJ<em>$1.2B of Binance funds seized</em></span></div></div>
